  "job_B20.20.2_20251003_114521": {
    "text": "Gif \u00f0e gelustfulla\u00f0 tod\u00e6lan \u00f0\u00e6s geres dagas o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6s d\u00e6ges tida, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nig o\u00f0er\nVncia h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00f0is taken, and Deunx o\u00f0\u00f0e Iabus h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00f0is taken, and Decunx o\u00f0\u00f0e dextans, \u00fe\u00e6t is se teo\u00f0a\nDodrans, o\u00f0\u00f0e dodras, \u00fe\u00e6t synt \u00f0a nigon d\u00e6las, beo\u00f0 \u00feus gesette.\nBes suie bisse, \u00fe\u00e6t synd \u00fea eahta d\u00e6las, beo\u00f0 \u00f0us gewur\u00f0od.\nSeptunx, \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00f0a seofon d\u00e6las beo\u00f0 \u00feus geswutlode.\nSemis, \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00f0us six d\u00e6las, \u00f0e beo\u00f0 \u00f0us gemencod.\nQuincunx uel cincus, \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00f0a fif d\u00e6las, \u00fee beo\u00f0 \u00f0us gehiwod.\nTriens uel treas, \u00fe\u00e6t synt \u00f0a feowor d\u00e6las, \u00fee beo\u00f0 \u00feus gehiwod.\nQuadrans, \u00fe\u00e6t synt \u00fea \u00f0reo d\u00e6las, \u00f0e beo\u00f0 \u00f0us amearcod.\nSextans, \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00fea twegen d\u00e6las, \u00fee beo\u00f0 \u00f0us amearcod.\nSemiuncia, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 healf uncia.\nVncia h\u00e6f\u00f0 XXIIII scripulos, and semiuncia h\u00e6f\u00f0 XII scripulos.\nScripuli sex quadrantem \u00feerficiunt. Dicitur scripulus alio nomine sicilicus. Greci uero dodrantem\nxxiiii scripuli wyrca\u00fe ane uncia, and semiuntia h\u00e6f\u00f0 xii scripulos.\nSemiuncia bi\u00f0 \u00f0us gemearcod due sextule siue sescle viii scripuli.\nDue sextule beo\u00fe \u00feus, and sicilicus beo\u00f0 sex scripuli, and bi\u00f0 \u00f0us amearcod.\nSextula siue sescle beo\u00f0 iiii scripuli, and by\u00f0 \u00f0us amearcod.\nDimidia sextula siue sescle beo\u00f0 twa scripuli, and bi\u00f0 \u00f0us amearcod.\nScripulus h\u00e6f\u00f0 six cilicus, and \u00f0a six silici o\u00f0\u00f0e silique wyrca\u00f0 anne scripulum, and \u00feus he is\n\u00dee d\u00e6g h\u00e6f\u00f0 xxiiii tida, and six twia scripuli wyrca\u00f0 healfe uncia, and twa semiuntia wyrca\u00f0 ane uncia.\nAn uncia stent on xxiiii penigum.\nTwelf si\u00feun twelf peningas beo\u00f0 on anum punde.\nNim \u00fea twelf of \u00f0am get\u00e6le and hat \u00f0a twelf vncia, and \u00f0a endluuon d\u00e6las deuncem.",
